// The 19 September 2005 Jagex update supplies the objective as information, not
// recovered TzHaar-Mej-Kah dialogue. Keep this verbatim source line in Talk-to.
[opnpc1,tzhaar_fightpit_master]
mes("The objective in the pit is simple Kill or be killed. Last one standing wins.");
// UNKNOWN plain functional information, not recovered NPC dialogue.
if (compare(%fightpits_champion_name, "") = 0) mes("Current Champion: TzHaar-Xil-Huz");
else mes("Current Champion: <%fightpits_champion_name>");
mes("The last contender standing wins Tokkul for defeated opponents.");
mes("You keep your items when defeated and return to the waiting room.");
mes("Enter through the hot vent door to wait for the next fight.");
